es.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1322y.jpg"}], "slug": "star-wars-the-force-unleashed--4", "storyline": "Star Wars: The Force Unleashed (PS2) follows Galen Marek (\"Starkiller\"), Darth Vader's secret apprentice, who hunts Jedi survivors after Order 66. As he hunts targets like Rahm Kota, he begins questioning his dark side training, ultimately turning against Vader and Sidious to help form the Rebel Alliance, leading to crucial choices between light and dark side endings.", "summary": "The PlayStation 2 version of Star Wars: The Force Unleashed (developed by Krome Studios) is fundamentally different from the PS3/360 versions, featuring 2\u20133 extra levels, shorter and differently designed missions, and no advanced Euphoria ragdoll physics. It functions more like a traditional action-adventure game with a local versus mode, offering a more complete story but inferior graphics.", "themes": [{"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/star-wars-the-force-unleashed--4", "videos": [{"id": 182020, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "Hb3yp19pEYc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Hb3yp19pEYc", "title": "PS2 - Star Wars: The Force Unleashed - Full Walkthrough [1080P: 60FPS]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Hb3yp19pEYc/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}